{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Principal component analysis (PCA) with varimax rotation of gait parameters from trials without FOG (n=1130 trials) revealed five orthogonally RPC accounting for 73% of variance (Fig. 2, Supplementary Fig. 2).\",\n    \"We examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and gait RPC scores, focusing first on trials without FOG in the DOPA OFF condition.\",\n    \"This study distinguishes between two FOG states —predisposition and occurrence —each characterized by distinct gait initiation strategies and STN neuronal activity patterns.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"In the 12 FOG+ patients, 99 trials included FOG events (FOG+/+ trials, DOPA OFF condition), with a median onset of 8 steps (IQR 6 -11.5) after gait initiation. A total of 263 FOG episodes were recorded (Fig 1e -g). These FOG + patients also completed 212 walking trials without FOG (FOG+/- trials, Fig 1e).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG+/+) to those without (FOG+/-) among FOG + patients (DOPAOFF condition, Fig 5).\",\n    \"We observed stronger negative associations between high beta band power and pace score in FOG+/+ vs. FOG+/- trials, significant only in the posterior STN (Fig 5a-c, Supplementary Fig. 6). In contrast, positive association between rhythm and both high beta and theta band activity emerged in the posterior STN during FOG+/+ trials, but were absent or reversed in FOG+/- trials (Fig 5d-f). For balance, we found a stronger negative association between high beta band power in the central STN and positive association with gamma band power in the posterior STN (Fig 5g-i).\",\n    \"FOG episodes were preceded by an increased association between high beta band activity and stepping rhythm in the posterior part of the STN, coupled with an inverse association between high beta band activity and balance in the central STN.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有部分全文依据。论文确实主要先使用无冻结试次进行步态参数PCA，并明确说明首先分析了DOPA-OFF状态下无FOG试次的STN-LFP与步态表现之间的关系。无冻结试次为1130次，也明显多于发生冻结的99次试次。但是，报告如果据此将整项研究主要归纳为冻结易感性研究，就遗漏了一个重要限定：原文另设Predictive patterns of FOG occurrence部分，专门比较发生冻结的FOG+/+试次与未发生冻结的FOG+/-试次，并报告了实际发生冻结的试次中posterior STN高beta活动与pace、rhythm的关联变化，以及central STN高beta活动与balance的关联变化。因此，报告并非完全没有依据，但其概括不完整，弱化了原文关于冻结发生的独立分析。指控者关于38名患者、12名FOG阳性患者、99次冻结试次、263次冻结事件、212次非冻结试次，以及两类试次之间STN活动关联差异的描述均有全文依据。需要保留一个重要精确性限定：原文分析的是步态启动阶段中后来发生冻结的试次，冻结事件的中位发生时间为步态启动后8步；因此，这些结果属于与实际冻结发生相关的启动期预测性证据，并不等于直接分析冻结动作正在发生时的神经活动，也不等于对263次冻结事件分别进行了独立的事件级神经信号分析。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f165d61-30df-4037-a764-ee4be927f9cf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125414494132Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:55:29.593900+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fdf18b9e0a68246fccac0dd9a9919468c5de4bbf0793b11900e792c1e8082185", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125414494132Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5800148ae7b40bbd711427817135c9a17e54f75c7af4d85c56f65acc5fa0c6f0"}}}
